      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "SqlSort supports additional to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> unsafe sort expressions. Such sort expressions get included in\na query as they are. The user has to ensure that they come from trusted sorted or are properly sanatized to prevent\nSQL injection attacks.",
      "translation": "SqlSort 支持除 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 之外的不安全排序表达式。此类排序表达式会原样包含在查询中。用户必须确保它们来自可信的排序源，或经过适当的清理以防止 SQL 注入攻击。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a> that keeps a flag to indicate unsafe property handling, i.e. the String provided is not\nnecessarily a property but can be an arbitrary expression piped into the query execution.",
      "translation": "自定义一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a>，其中包含一个标志位以指示不安全的属性处理方式，即所提供的字符串不一定是一个属性，而可能是一个任意表达式，该表达式会被管道式地传入查询执行中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>order</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a> to validate. Must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>order</code> - 要验证的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a>。不能为 null。",
